Description: C++ Libraries for the Unidata network Common Data Form (gnu15 + impi, OpenHPC)
 NetCDF-CXX4 provides a C++ interface for NetCDF, a set of software
 libraries and data formats for array-oriented scientific data.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family and impi MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
